Share text from the shell:

  git diff | paste
  paste notes.txt --expire 7d
  paste --name fix.patch < fix.patch

It prints the address, like https://runv.club/~you/p/abc12.txt.
Pastes go away after 30 days unless you pick --expire 1h, 1d, 7d or
never. Up to 1MB each.

  paste --list       what you have and when it expires
  paste --rm NAME    remove one now

Pastes are public, anyone with the link can read them.
